<h1>BA human QC · quick trace skim</h1><p>Skim the path, inspect anything odd, and record a decision. A quick skim is not full-video validation. Recommendations do not remove data.</p>
<header><label>Reviewer <input id="reviewer" value="VAF" size="7"></label><button id="export">Download QC JSON</button><button id="csv">Download summary CSV</button><label>Import QC JSON <input id="import" type="file" accept=".json"></label><span id="progress"></span></header>
<div class="layout"><aside><input id="search" placeholder="Search run or recording" aria-label="Search runs"><select id="filter" aria-label="Filter runs"><option value="all">All runs · QC order</option value="unreviewed">Not yet skimmed</option><option value="flagged">Flagged / exclude</option><option value="usable_skim">Looks usable</option></select><div id="gallery" class="gallery"></div></aside>
<main><div class="panel"><div class="toolbar"><button id="prev">Previous</button><button id="next">Next</button><button id="nextOpen">Next unreviewed</button><b id="title"></b></div><div id="label"></div><p id="metrics"></p><small id="auto"></small><p id="versionNote"></p><p id="turtleStatus" style="color:#9238b1;font-weight:bold"></p><small>Purple: automatic turtling candidate · pink: your possible-turtling interval. Frozen 0.4 development rules applied to this strict track; not confirmed posture. Gray/unassessed is not negative.</small><p id="strictStatus" style="color:#a53716;font-weight:bold"></p></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="views"><section><div class="toolbar"><label><input type="checkbox" id="raw"> Raw baseline</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="pro"> Delivered proposal (comparison)</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="strict" checked> Strict analysis track</label></div><canvas id="trace" width="500" height="500" aria-label="Full spatial trajectory"></canvas><p class="legend">Default teal: strict track, with unresolved jump endpoints removed. Comparison proposal retains red jump lines. A blocked run has no usable movement summary. Gaps are never joined. Click a path point to inspect its time.</p></section><section><div class="videoWrap"><video id="video" playsinline preload="metadata"></video><canvas id="overlay" width="500" height="500" aria-label="Proposed position circle and recent path"></canvas></div><small id="overlayStatus"></small><div class="toolbar"><label><input id="overlayOn" type="checkbox" checked> Circle + recent path</label></div><small>Teal: selected track · orange: changed from raw · gray: optional raw comparison. Video trails never connect ≥100 px jumps. Circle follows the proposal, not a confirmed beetle position.</small><b id="frame"></b><div class="toolbar"><button id="play">Play / pause</button><button id="back">−1 frame</button><button id="forward">+1 frame</button><select id="speed" aria-label="Playback speed"><option value="1">1×</option><option value="2">2×</option><option value="4">4×</option><option value="0.5">0.5×</option></select></div><input id="seek" type="range" step="1" aria-label="Global video frame"><div class="toolbar"><button id="excerpt">Play 10 s around here</button><button id="full">Play full run</button><label>Frame <input id="goto" type="number" size="8" style="width:110px"></label><button id="go">Go</button></div><small id="mediaStatus"></small></section></div>
<canvas id="timeplot" width="1100" height="130" aria-label="Adjacent step size and missing tracking over time"></canvas><small>Click timeline to seek. Gray step trace; red bars: jumps; orange: unexpected missing tracking; dark gray: human-excluded frames; purple: automatic turtling; pink: your turtling flags. Step height is capped at 200 px for display.</small><div id="events"></div><details><summary>Earlier attributed review notes</summary><div id="prior"></div></details></div>
<div class="panel"><h2 style="font-size:19px">Your quick QC decision</h2><div id="flags" class="flags"></div><p><label>What did you inspect? <select id="scope"><option value="trace_skim">Trace skim</option><option value="trace_and_excerpt">Trace + short video</option><option value="trace_and_full_video">Trace + full video</option></select></label></p><textarea id="notes" rows="2" placeholder="Optional detail: where the trace looks wrong, why exclude, what might help fix it"></textarea><div class="toolbar"><button id="turtleStart">Mark turtling start</button><button id="turtleEnd">Mark turtling end</button><button id="turtleClear">Clear turtling intervals</button><span id="turtleRanges"></span><button id="markStart">Mark issue start here</button><button id="markEnd">Mark issue end here</button><button id="clearRanges">Clear optional intervals</button><span id="ranges"></span></div><small>Intervals are optional QC locations, not posture scores or tracking exclusions.</small><div class="toolbar"><button id="usable" class="good">Looks usable · save & next</button><button id="flag">Needs closer review · save & next</button><button id="exclude" class="bad">Recommend exclusion · save & next</button></div><b id="saved"></b><p id="msg" role="status"></p><small>Saved locally in this browser. Download JSON to preserve decisions and reviewer history. Unreviewed runs remain unreviewed. Exclusion recommendations require a separate downstream inclusion decision.</small></div></main></div>
